{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Delay"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Delay\/timeout(_:clock:tolerance:customError:)"},"abstract":[{"text":"Fails if the sequence goes the given duration without producing an element, measured on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the given clock.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"timeout"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"duration"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Duration","preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency5ClockP8DurationQa"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"clock"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tolerance"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Duration","preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency5ClockP8DurationQa"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"customError"},{"kind":"text","text":": (any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Error","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5ErrorP"},{"kind":"text","text":")? = nil) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncSequences","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Timeout","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO7TimeoutV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Timeout"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Clock","preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency5ClockP"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"duration","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The longest the sequence may go without an element."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"clock","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The clock that measures the gaps.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"tolerance","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The tolerance of the timer’s sleeps. Defaults to ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"customError","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The error to throw when the timer fires. Defaults to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TimeoutError.timedOut(duration:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A sequence of the same elements that throws if the upstream goes quiet.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The timer starts when iteration begins and restarts with every element, so it bounds the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wait for the first element and each gap after it, never the sequence as a whole. Elements","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pass through unchanged. When the timer fires, the upstream is cancelled and the sequence","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"throws, without waiting for the upstream to respond to the cancellation.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The upstream is read ahead of the consumer, and elements it produces while the consumer is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"busy are buffered, so the timer measures the upstream’s gaps. A duration of zero or less"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws before the first element."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Example","level":2,"text":"Example"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let clock = ContinuousClock()","for try await line in bytes.lines.timeout(.seconds(30), clock: clock) {","    handle(line)","}"]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Throws","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"TimeoutError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (or ","type":"text"},{"code":"customError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") when ","type":"text"},{"code":"duration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" passes between elements, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"any error the upstream throws.","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"On WASI, a sleep on a real clock (","type":"text"},{"code":"ContinuousClock","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"SuspendingClock","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") holds the one thread","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"until its deadline, even when other work is ready, and cancelling it doesn’t end it sooner. So the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"timer can hold the thread before the upstream runs, then count that wait against it and throw even","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"though elements were ready. A test clock is unaffected.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","extendedModule":"_Concurrency","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"relatedModules":["_Concurrency"],"name":"Afluent"}],"title":"timeout(_:clock:tolerance:customError:)","platforms":[{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false,"name":"iPadOS","deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false,"name":"macOS","deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false,"name":"tvOS","deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS","deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"9.0","unavailable":false,"name":"watchOS","deprecated":false}],"externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE7timeout_5clock9tolerance11customErrorAA14AsyncSequencesO7TimeoutVy_xqd__G8DurationQyd___qd__AOSgs0H0_pSgt12_Concurrency5ClockRd__lF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO5DelayV","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Element"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"remoteSource":{"fileName":"TimeoutSequence.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/SequenceOperators\/TimeoutSequence.swift#L217"},"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"timeout"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"